 interestingBtn:T('✨ Tell me something interesting','✨ Kuch interesting batao','✨ कुछ दिलचस्प बताओ'),easyBtn:T('🌱 Something easy today','🌱 Aaj kuch easy padhein','🌱 आज कुछ आसान पढ़ें'),
